        "Description": "Greetings, after searching for a while, I have managed to find more clones as well as The Cloner himself! The elderly muffin lady was a setup, she wasn&apos;t really The Cloner. They had set up hidden cameras around her house and saw everything, they&apos;ve found us, they&apos;ll burst through my door any minute now so I&apos;ll make this fast: The REAL Cloner is-\r\r[MESSAGE END]",
